  "details": "VRChat crashed when I was taking multi-layered photos. It happened again, but then I realized it's because my photo resolution was too high. This happens with 4K and 8K photos. Anything below this seemed stable.\n\nSpecs:\n\nNVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 SUPER\n\nIntel(R) Core(TM) i9-9900K CPU @ 3.60GHz (16 CPUs)\n\nZ390 Aorus Ultra\n\nVENGEANCE® LPX (4 x 8GB) DDR4 DRAM 3600MHz C18\n\nVideo:\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1070428871750598756\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1070428871121440851/2023-02-01_14-40-22.mp4",
